                "12.00 / 0.80 = 15.00. Inverse identity N / d = 30.00 / 12.00 = 2.50 = "
                "1/k_e. Speckleveil 1.20 um is a last-good inversion the vendor can write. "
                "Plant LVDT and skin TC are witnesses Speckleveil cannot write. Ordered: "
                "isolate S-4 now. Scope: this ACCEPT does not authorize S-1..S-3 (those "
                "skirts are out of scope) and does not trip the hydrocracker."
